  "evidencia": "Page: Sigourney Weaver. Sentence: Following her film debut as a minor character in \"Annie Hall\" (1977), she quickly came to prominence with her first lead role as Ellen Ripley in \"Alien\" (1979).\nPage: Sigourney Weaver. Sentence: She reprised the role in three sequels: \"Aliens\" (1986), for which she was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress; \"Alien 3\" (1992), and \"Alien Resurrection\" (1997).\nPage: Alien Resurrection. Sentence: It is the fourth installment in the \"Alien\" film series, and the final installment in the original series.\nPage: Deal of the Century. Sentence: Deal of the Century is a 1983 American comedy film directed by William Friedkin and starring Chevy Chase, Gregory Hines, and Sigourney Weaver.",
